Toss onto the complex plane so that the circumcircle of  $ABCD$  is the unit circle. Then, clearly  $e=\tfrac{a+b}{2}, f = \tfrac{b+c}{2}, g = \tfrac{c+d}{2}, h = \tfrac{a+d}{2}.$  To find  $w,$  taking a homothety with scale factor  $\tfrac{1}{2}$  centered at  $A$  sends  $\triangle ADB \rightarrow \triangle AHE$  so  $w=\tfrac{2a+b+d}{2}$  and similarly  $x=\tfrac{2b+c+a}{2},$   $y=\tfrac{2c+d+b}{2},$   $z=\tfrac{2d+a+c}{2}.$ We now compute:
\begin{align*}
[ABCD] &= [ABC]+[CDA] 
&= \frac{i}{4} \begin{vmatrix}a&\tfrac{1}{a}&1[3pt]b&\tfrac{1}{b}&1[3pt]c&\tfrac{1}{c}&1\end{vmatrix} + \frac{i}{4}\begin{vmatrix}c&\tfrac{1}{c}&1[3pt]d&\tfrac{1}{d}&1[3pt]a&\tfrac{1}{a}&1\end{vmatrix} 
&=\tfrac{i}{4}\left(\tfrac{a}{b}-\tfrac{a}{c}+\tfrac{b}{c}-\tfrac{b}{a}+\tfrac{c}{a}-\tfrac{c}{b} \right) + \tfrac{i}{4}\left(\tfrac{c}{d}-\tfrac{c}{a}+\tfrac{d}{a}-\tfrac{d}{c}+\tfrac{a}{c}-\tfrac{a}{d} \right) 
&= \tfrac{i}{4}\left(\tfrac{a}{b}-\tfrac{b}{a}+\tfrac{b}{c}-\tfrac{c}{b}+\tfrac{c}{d}-\tfrac{d}{c}+\tfrac{d}{a}-\tfrac{a}{d} \right).
\end{align*}
To ease calcuations for  $[WXYZ],$  perform the translation  $p \mapsto p-\tfrac{1}{2}\left(a+b+c+d\right).$  Then  $w'=\tfrac{a-c}{2}, x'=\tfrac{b-d}{2}, y'=\tfrac{c-a}{2}, w'=\tfrac{d-b}{2},$  so we have
\begin{align*}
[WXYZ] = [W'X'Y'Z'] &= [W'X'Y']+[Y'Z'W'] 
&= \frac{i}{4} \begin{vmatrix}w'&\overline{w'}&1[3pt]x'&\overline{x'}&1[3pt]y'&\overline{y'}&1\end{vmatrix} + \frac{i}{4}\begin{vmatrix}y'&\overline{y'}&1[3pt]z'&\overline{z'}&1[3pt]w'&\overline{w'}&1\end{vmatrix} 
&= \frac{i}{4} \begin{vmatrix}\tfrac{a-c}{2}&\tfrac{1}{2a}-\tfrac{1}{2c}&1[3pt]\tfrac{b-d}{2}&\tfrac{1}{2b}-\tfrac{1}{2d}&1[3pt]\tfrac{c-a}{2}&\tfrac{1}{2c}-\tfrac{1}{2a}&1\end{vmatrix} + \frac{i}{4}\begin{vmatrix}\tfrac{c-a}{2}&\tfrac{1}{2c}-\tfrac{1}{2a}&1[3pt]\tfrac{d-b}{2}&\tfrac{1}{2d}-\tfrac{1}{2b}&1[3pt]\tfrac{a-c}{2}&\tfrac{1}{2a}-\tfrac{1}{2c}&1\end{vmatrix} 
&= \tfrac{i}{4}\left(\tfrac{a}{b}-\tfrac{b}{a}+\tfrac{b}{c}-\tfrac{c}{b}+\tfrac{c}{d}-\tfrac{d}{c}+\tfrac{d}{a}-\tfrac{a}{d} \right)
\end{align*}
so we are done.  $\blacksquare$

