Number each of the vertices from  $1$  to  $3$  in the following repeating pattern:
[asy]
for (int i = 0; i <= 4; ++i) {
  draw(i * dir(60) -- i * dir(60) + (4-i) * dir(0));
  draw(i * dir(0) -- i * dir(0) + (4-i) * dir(60));
  draw(i * dir(0) -- i * dir(0) + (i) * dir(120));
