\end{align*}
Thus, it remains to check that  $|c^2+aq+cq|=|c^2+aq+ca|$ . We see
\[|c^2+aq+cq|^2=(c^2+aq+cq)(1/c^2+1/aq+1/cq)=3 + (c^2/aq+aq/c^2) + (a/c+c/a) + (q/c+c/q),\]
which is symmetric under  $a\leftrightarrow q$  interchange, as desired.

