because of the miraculous identity  $\sin(180 + \theta) = \sin \theta$ . Note that for each angle  $\theta \in \{1, 3, \dots, 359\}$  the complex number with that argument is a root of  $z^{180} = -1$ . We are looking to then compute the product,
