Hmmm so it turns out I've studied this configuration before! :D

<details><summary>Overkill (but maybe similar to budu's?)</summary>[asy]
draw((0,0)--(0,5)--(5,5)--(5,0)--cycle);
filldraw((0,4)--(1,4)--(1,5)--(0,5)--cycle, gray);
