x^2+y^2+z^2+mxy+nxz+pyz & \geq \left(3\sum_{cyc}{ p^{2/3}}\right)\left( \sqrt[3(p^{2/3}+q^{2/3}+r^{2/3})]{\prod_{cyc}{\left( \frac{x^2}{p^{2/3}}\right) ^{p^{2/3}}}\cdot \prod_{cyc}{\left( \frac{mxy}{2\cdot m^{2/3}}\right) ^{2\cdot m^{2/3}}}}\right)
& =\left(3\sum_{cyc}{ p^{2/3}}\right) \sqrt[3]{\prod_{cyc}{\frac{x^2}{4}}} 
& = 6\sqrt[3]{2}\sum_{cyc}{m^{2/3}} 
\end{align*}
Equality holds at  $x=\sqrt[3]{4p},y=\sqrt[3]{4n},z=\sqrt[3]{4m}$ .

