We compute
\begin{align*}
(\mathbb Z/35\mathbb Z)[x]/(x^2 + 1) &= \mathbb F_5[x]/(x^2 + 1) \times \mathbb F_7[x]/(x^2 + 1) 
&= \mathbb F_5[x]/((x - 2)(x - 3)) \times \mathbb F_{49} 
&= \mathbb F_5[x]/(x - 2) \times \mathbb F_5[x]/(x - 3) \times \mathbb F_{49} 
&= \mathbb F_5^2 \times \mathbb F_{49}
\end{align*}
by Chinese remainder theorem. Since the multiplicative group of a finite field is cyclic, the answer is  $\left(\frac{5 + 1}{2}\right)^2 \cdot \frac{49 + 1}2 = 225$ .

