Now note by Reim that  $GHXC$  is cyclic, and that  $\angle GBC = \angle GHC = 90^\circ$ , so  $GBHC$  is cyclic. But this implies \[\angle HAX = 90^\circ - \angle ACB = \angle HBC = 180^\circ - \angle HXC = \angle AXH\] so we are done.

